{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/4c79f2e8a77b97ca72e2d67d5143eacb.avif?t=1773990692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras_big/4c79f2e8a77b97ca72e2d67d5143eacb.webp?t=1773990692 width=1560 height=399 /></span>\ud83d\udc20<strong>\u2728An aquarium right on your screen\u2728</strong>\ud83d\udc20</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/253c465779719168ea0ccab96475ddb1.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=948 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/253c465779719168ea0ccab96475ddb1.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/253c465779719168ea0ccab96475ddb1.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>\ud83d\udc1f Fish live on your desktop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your desktop turns into a cozy aquarium where fish swim over your games, your work, or whatever you\u2019re doing, bringing a gentle and playful vibe to your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for idle play, Desktop Fishes lets you enjoy a relaxing aquarium experience at your own pace. Your fishes will thrive even when you're busy doing other things </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728\u2728Features\u2728\u2728</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd5a<strong>Growth Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fish starts as a tiny egg. You\u2019ll see them wiggle, hatch, and slowly grow into adults \u2014 each stage is its own little moment to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/fa29c071483bd446d33c8ffe21e2f008.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/fa29c071483bd446d33c8ffe21e2f008.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/fa29c071483bd446d33c8ffe21e2f008.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f<strong>Dress them up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your fish some style with hats, glasses, and fun accessories, making each one feel unique and full of character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/069c44561949c1319b0086666af825c1.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/069c44561949c1319b0086666af825c1.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/069c44561949c1319b0086666af825c1.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9e\u00a0 Breed and discover new fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your fish reproduce and pass down traits to their babies. Some inherit colors and patterns from their parents, while others show up with rare mutations. <strong>There are over 10,000 possible genetic combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/829a59d439e9b9cc95786ab8f5f7d0de.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/829a59d439e9b9cc95786ab8f5f7d0de.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/829a59d439e9b9cc95786ab8f5f7d0de.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31<strong>Cut the seaweed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your aquarium grows seaweed fast, and it\u2019s up to you to cut it back! Luckily, your fish munch on the extra plants, helping you keep the tank clear and lively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/69c00efb96f36577b131cd8c49ada7b3.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/69c00efb96f36577b131cd8c49ada7b3.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/69c00efb96f36577b131cd8c49ada7b3.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc19<strong> The octopus market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange but merchant with plenty of goods. Buy food, toys, and odd accessories that add charm (and weirdness) to your aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/44155e014ea1c76272ae3d41b2fb1e36.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/44155e014ea1c76272ae3d41b2fb1e36.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/44155e014ea1c76272ae3d41b2fb1e36.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong> \ud83c\udf33 Skill tree! (because everything\u2019s better with a skill tree)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your aquarium through a set of upgrades. Unlock perks, change the behaviour of your fish, and customize your experience however you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/9eefbf993971172fecd276474f1c1add.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/9eefbf993971172fecd276474f1c1add.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/9eefbf993971172fecd276474f1c1add.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Wallpaper mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how your aquarium lives on your desktop. Let the fish swim over your windows like an overlay, or place them behind everything as a living wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/ff26eafafbc27a1e761131538ce67cf9.poster.avif?t=1773990692\" width=608 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/ff26eafafbc27a1e761131538ce67cf9.webm?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618880/extras/ff26eafafbc27a1e761131538ce67cf9.mp4?t=1773990692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the fun, explore endless fishy combinations, and bring your desktop to life with your own vibrant, swimming friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First catch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/00a68229105f07ca7b86e9e7ea2b47e09b09e814.jpg"},{"name":"Fish keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/5d4bbdb6a2e1b858cc38e8f6fb5bfe61a43e9761.jpg"},{"name":"Fish enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/e5835d9656974f0775d08ee844db07fd313623ea.jpg"},{"name":"Fish lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/5dd59cdb07dc37c3182390b0bd9a57aca49d6806.jpg"},{"name":"Fish maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/fb4592774765a06e4a613ce44dc4ace34420c009.jpg"},{"name":"Fish god","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/10c33d1d08f1b1af859d9cb1628191a8a4a4a4bc.jpg"},{"name":"Egg buyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/7a561d79d09002a854764a60ff81301aaf653656.jpg"},{"name":"Egg analyst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/539db6829844536410bc35158e490158a8794643.jpg"},{"name":"Egg hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/6f7171f496b8713fffa132e41a3f2a07cc1ecafe.jpg"},{"name":"Egg spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618880/01a41d06d8caaa49de9babc037169694219f4eef.jpg"}],"total":3